      "---",
      "",
      "## Day 8：INNER JOIN",
      "",
      "### 为什么需要 JOIN",
      "",
      "在关系数据库中，为了减少数据冗余，我们通常把相关但不相同的数据放在不同表中。",
      "",
      "比如 `books` 表里有 `author_id`，而不是直接存作者名。这样如果作者改名了，只需要改一条记录。",
      "",
      "但查询时，我们需要把两张表「拼」回来。这就是 JOIN 的作用。",
      "",
      "### INNER JOIN 语法",
      "",
      "```sql",
      "SELECT a.col1, b.col2",
      "FROM table_a a",
      "INNER JOIN table_b b ON a.id = b.a_id;",
      "```",
      "",
      "**INNER JOIN（内连接）只返回两表中都匹配的行**。",
      "",
      "可以理解为集合论中的**交集**：",
      "",
      "```",
      "  A 表       交集        B 表",
      "┌──────┐              ┌──────┐",
      "│      │  ┌────────┐  │      │",
      "│  ●   │  │ ●   ●  │  │  ●   │",
      "│  ●   │  │ ●   ●  │  │  ●   │",
      "│      │  └────────┘  │      │",
      "└──────┘              └──────┘",
      "```"
    ]
  },
  {
    "cell_id": "cell-3",
    "cell_type": "code",
    "source": [
      "# Day 8：INNER JOIN 练习",
      "",
      "# 查询每本书的书名和作者名",
      "!docker exec pg-learn psql -U postgres -d learn -c \"",
      "SELECT b.title, a.name AS author",
      "FROM bookstore.books b",
      "INNER JOIN bookstore.authors a ON b.author_id = a.id",
      "ORDER BY b.title;",
      "\"",
      "",
      "print(\"---\")",
      "",
      "# 别名简写：INNER JOIN 可以简写为 JOIN",
      "# 查询每笔销售：顾客名、书名、数量、日期",
      "!docker exec pg-learn psql -U postgres -d learn -c \"",
      "SELECT c.name AS 顾客, b.title AS 书名, s.quantity AS 数量, s.sale_date::date AS 日期",
      "FROM bookstore.sales s",
      "JOIN bookstore.books b ON s.book_id = b.id",
      "JOIN bookstore.customers c ON s.customer_id = c.id",
      "ORDER BY s.sale_date;",
      "\""
    ]
  },
  {
    "cell_id": "cell-4",
    "cell_type": "markdown",
    "source": [
      "### 关于表别名",
      "",
      "注意上面我们用了 `FROM bookstore.books b`——这里的 `b` 就是 `bookstore.books` 的**别名**。",
      "",
      "别名的作用：",
      "1. **简化书写**：`bookstore.books` vs `b`",
      "2. **消除歧义**：多表 JOIN 时，不同表可能有同名列（如 `id`），用 `b.id` `a.id` 区分",
      "",
      "### 多表 JOIN 的执行顺序",
      "",
      "逻辑上，SQL 的执行顺序是：",
      "",
      "```",
      "FROM sales s",
      "  JOIN books b ON s.book_id = b.id     ← 先连接 sales + books",
      "    JOIN customers c ON s.customer_id = c.id  ← 再连接 + customers",
      "```",
      "",
      "但实际上数据库优化器会自己决定最优的执行顺序，你只需要保证 JOIN 条件正确。"
    ]
  },
  {
    "cell_id": "cell-5",
    "cell_type": "markdown",
    "source": [
      "---",
      "",
      "## Day 9：LEFT / RIGHT / FULL OUTER JOIN",
      "",
      "INNER JOIN 只返回匹配的行。但有时你需要保留某张表的**所有**行，即使另一张表没有匹配。",
      "",
      "### LEFT JOIN",
      "",
      "保留**左表**所有行，右表无匹配时填 NULL：",
      "",
      "```sql",
      "SELECT * FROM left_table l",
      "LEFT JOIN right_table r ON l.id = r.l_id;",
      "```",
      "",
      "### RIGHT JOIN",
      "",
      "保留**右表**所有行。不常用（可以改写为 LEFT JOIN 把表顺序调换）。",
      "",
      "### FULL JOIN",
      "",
      "保留两表所有行。",
      "",
      "### 自 JOIN",
      "",
      "表和自己 JOIN，用两个不同的别名区分。",
      "",
      "```",
      "  LEFT JOIN               FULL JOIN",
      "┌──────┐               ┌──────┐",
      "│ ●    │               │ ●    │",
      "│ ● ── │               │ ● ── │",
      "│ ●    │               │ ● ── │",
      "└──────┘               └──────┘",
      " 左表全保留           左右都全保留",
      "```"
    ]
  },
  {
    "cell_id": "cell-6",
    "cell_type": "code",
    "source": [
      "# Day 9：LEFT / RIGHT / FULL JOIN 练习",
      "",
      "# 找出还没有任何销售记录的书",
      "# LEFT JOIN + WHERE 右表 IS NULL 是经典模式",
      "!docker exec pg-learn psql -U postgres -d learn -c \"",
      "SELECT b.title, b.price",
      "FROM bookstore.books b",
      "LEFT JOIN bookstore.sales s ON b.id = s.book_id",
      "WHERE s.id IS NULL;",
      "\"",
      "",
      "print(\"---\")",
      "",
      "# 找出所有顾客以及他们的购买次数（包括没买过的顾客）",
      "!docker exec pg-learn psql -U postgres -d learn -c \"",
      "SELECT c.name, c.level, COUNT(s.id) AS 购买次数",
      "FROM bookstore.customers c",
      "LEFT JOIN bookstore.sales s ON c.id = s.customer_id",
      "GROUP BY c.id, c.name, c.level",
      "ORDER BY 购买次数 DESC;",
      "\"",
      "",
      "print(\"---\")",
      "",
      "# FULL JOIN 演示：看看作者和他们写的书",
