      "INSERT INTO bookstore.books (title, author_id, price, stock, isbn)",
      "VALUES ('无名之书', 999, 20.00, 5, '0000000000000')",
      "ON CONFLICT (isbn) DO NOTHING;",
      "\"",
      "",
      "# FULL JOIN 查询",
      "!docker exec pg-learn psql -U postgres -d learn -c \"",
      "SELECT a.name AS author, b.title AS book",
      "FROM bookstore.authors a",
      "FULL JOIN bookstore.books b ON a.id = b.author_id",
      "ORDER BY a.name NULLS FIRST;",
      "\"",
      "",
      "# 清理测试数据",
      "!docker exec pg-learn psql -U postgres -d learn -c \"DELETE FROM bookstore.books WHERE isbn = '0000000000000';\"",
      "",
      "print(\"---\")",
      "",
      "# 自 JOIN 示例：同一作者写的多本书配对",
      "!docker exec pg-learn psql -U postgres -d learn -c \"",
      "SELECT b1.title AS 书1, b2.title AS 书2, a.name AS 作者",
      "FROM bookstore.books b1",
      "JOIN bookstore.books b2 ON b1.author_id = b2.author_id AND b1.id < b2.id",
      "JOIN bookstore.authors a ON b1.author_id = a.id;",
      "\""
    ]
  },
  {
    "cell_id": "cell-7",
    "cell_type": "markdown",
    "source": [
      "### NULL 的陷阱",
      "",
      "LEFT JOIN 中右表没有匹配时填 NULL，查询时要注意：",
      "",
      "```sql",
      "-- 错误的写法：NULL = NULL 是 false！",
      "WHERE s.id = NULL;",
      "",
      "-- 正确的写法",
      "WHERE s.id IS NULL;",
      "```",
      "",
      "> 记住：**NULL ≠ NULL**。在 SQL 中，NULL 代表「未知」，两个未知的东西不能确定相等。要用 `IS NULL` / `IS NOT NULL`。",
      "",
      "这也影响聚合函数：",
      "- `COUNT(*)` 会统计 NULL 行",
      "- `COUNT(column)` 不会统计 NULL 行",
      "- `SUM(column)` 会忽略 NULL"
    ]
  },
  {
    "cell_id": "cell-8",
    "cell_type": "markdown",
    "source": [
      "---",
      "",
      "## Day 10：GROUP BY 与聚合函数",
      "",
      "### 五大聚合函数",
      "",
      "| 函数 | 说明 | 注意事项 |",
      "|------|------|----------|",
      "| `COUNT(*)` | 统计行数 | 包括 NULL |",
      "| `COUNT(col)` | 统计非 NULL 值数量 | 排除 NULL |",
      "| `COUNT(DISTINCT col)` | 统计不重复的非 NULL 值 | 去重统计 |",
      "| `SUM(col)` | 求和 | 忽略 NULL |",
      "| `AVG(col)` | 平均值 | 忽略 NULL |",
      "| `MIN(col)` | 最小值 | 文本按字典序 |",
      "| `MAX(col)` | 最大值 | 日期可用 |",
      "",
      "### GROUP BY 的执行逻辑",
      "",
      "1. 先按 GROUP BY 的列**分组**（相同值的行归为一组）",
      "2. 对每个分组**执行聚合函数**",
      "3. 返回每个分组的一行结果",
      "",
      "```sql",
      "-- 执行逻辑：按 category 分组 → 每组算 AVG(price)",
      "SELECT category, AVG(price) FROM products",
      "GROUP BY category;",
      "```",
      "",
      "### HAVING：对聚合结果做过滤",
      "",
      "`WHERE` 是在分组**前**过滤行（过滤原始数据）",
      "`HAVING` 是在分组**后**过滤组（过滤聚合结果）",
      "",
      "```sql",
      "SELECT category, COUNT(*) AS cnt, AVG(price) AS avg_price",
      "FROM products",
      "WHERE stock > 0        -- 分组前：只考虑有库存的商品",
      "GROUP BY category",
      "HAVING COUNT(*) >= 3;  -- 分组后：只保留商品数量 >= 3 的分类",
      "```"
    ]
  },
  {
