      "---",
      "",
      "## Day 11：子查询",
      "",
      "子查询就是**查询里的查询**。相当于先用一个查询得到一个中间结果，再基于它做外层查询。",
      "",
      "### 子查询的四种用法",
      "",
      "| 类型 | 位置 | 返回 | 示例 |",
      "|------|------|------|------|",
      "| **标量子查询** | SELECT 或 WHERE 中 | 单个值 | `WHERE price > (SELECT AVG(price) FROM books)` |",
      "| **IN / NOT IN** | WHERE 中 | 一列值 | `WHERE id IN (SELECT book_id FROM sales)` |",
      "| **EXISTS** | WHERE 中 | 布尔值（是否返回行） | `WHERE EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM sales WHERE ...)` |",
      "| **派生表** | FROM 中 | 多行多列（临时表） | `FROM (SELECT ...) AS sub` |",
      "",
      "### EXISTS vs IN",
      "",
      "`EXISTS` 通常比 `IN` 快，因为：",
      "- `IN` 需要先把子查询的所有结果计算出来",
      "- `EXISTS` 找到第一条匹配就返回 true，可以提前停止",
      "",
      "```sql",
      "-- IN：先算出所有有销售记录的 book_id",
      "SELECT * FROM books WHERE id IN (SELECT book_id FROM sales);",
      "",
      "-- EXISTS：逐行检查，找到就停",
      "SELECT * FROM books b WHERE EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM sales s WHERE s.book_id = b.id);",
      "```"
    ]
  },
  {
    "cell_id": "cell-12",
    "cell_type": "code",
    "source": [
      "# Day 11：子查询练习",
      "",
      "# 1. 标量子查询：价格高于平均价的书籍",
      "!docker exec pg-learn psql -U postgres -d learn -c \"",
      "SELECT title, price",
      "FROM bookstore.books",
      "WHERE price > (SELECT AVG(price) FROM bookstore.books)",
      "ORDER BY price;",
      "\"",
      "",
      "print(\"---\")",
      "",
      "# 2. 标量子查询在 SELECT 中：显示每本书的价格与平均价的差距",
      "!docker exec pg-learn psql -U postgres -d learn -c \"",
      "SELECT title, price,",
      "       (SELECT ROUND(AVG(price), 2) FROM bookstore.books) AS 均价,",
      "       ROUND(price - (SELECT AVG(price) FROM bookstore.books), 2) AS 差价",
      "FROM bookstore.books",
      "ORDER BY 差价 DESC;",
      "\"",
      "",
      "print(\"---\")",
      "",
      "# 3. IN 子查询：至少被卖过一次的书",
      "!docker exec pg-learn psql -U postgres -d learn -c \"",
      "SELECT title, price FROM bookstore.books",
      "WHERE id IN (SELECT DISTINCT book_id FROM bookstore.sales)",
      "ORDER BY title;",
      "\"",
      "",
      "print(\"---\")",
      "",
      "# 4. EXISTS 版本（功能相同，但写法不同）",
      "!docker exec pg-learn psql -U postgres -d learn -c \"",
      "SELECT b.title, b.price",
      "FROM bookstore.books b",
      "WHERE EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM bookstore.sales s WHERE s.book_id = b.id)",
      "ORDER BY b.title;",
      "\"",
      "",
      "print(\"---\")",
      "",
      "# 5. 派生表：找出销量超过所有书平均销量的书",
      "!docker exec pg-learn psql -U postgres -d learn -c \"",
      "WITH book_sales AS (",
      "    SELECT b.id, b.title, COALESCE(SUM(s.quantity), 0) AS total_sold",
      "    FROM bookstore.books b",
      "    LEFT JOIN bookstore.sales s ON b.id = s.book_id",
      "    GROUP BY b.id, b.title",
      ")",
      "SELECT * FROM book_sales",
      "WHERE total_sold > (SELECT AVG(total_sold) FROM book_sales)",
      "ORDER BY total_sold DESC;",
      "\""
    ]
  },
