      "---",
      "",
      "## Day 12：CTE（公用表表达式）",
      "",
      "CTE 就是**命名的子查询**——先用 `WITH` 定义一个临时结果集，然后在后续查询中像表一样引用它。",
      "",
      "### 为什么用 CTE？",
      "",
      "1. **可读性**：把复杂的查询拆成一个个有名字的步骤",
      "2. **可复用**：同一个 CTE 可以在后面的查询中被多次引用",
      "3. **递归**：`WITH RECURSIVE` 可以处理树形/层级数据",
      "",
      "### 基本语法",
      "",
      "```sql",
      "WITH cte_name AS (",
      "    -- 这是 CTE 的内部查询",
      "    SELECT ...",
      ")",
      "-- 这是主查询，可以引用 cte_name",
      "SELECT * FROM cte_name WHERE ...;",
      "```",
      "",
      "### 链式 CTE",
      "",
      "多个 CTE 用逗号分隔，后面的可以引用前面的：",
      "",
      "```sql",
      "WITH",
      "    step1 AS (SELECT ...),",
      "    step2 AS (SELECT * FROM step1 WHERE ...),",
      "    step3 AS (SELECT col, COUNT(*) FROM step2 GROUP BY col)",
      "SELECT * FROM step3;",
      "```",
      "",
      "### 递归 CTE — 处理树/图结构",
      "",
      "递归 CTE 由两部分组成：",
      "1. **基准查询**（Anchor）：递归的起点",
      "2. **递归查询**：用 `UNION ALL` 连接，引用自身",
      "",
      "```sql",
      "WITH RECURSIVE name AS (",
      "    -- 基准查询",
      "    SELECT ... WHERE base_condition",
      "    UNION ALL",
      "    -- 递归查询",
      "    SELECT ... FROM name WHERE recursive_condition",
      ")",
      "SELECT * FROM name;",
      "```"
    ]
  },
  {
    "cell_id": "cell-14",
    "cell_type": "code",
    "source": [
      "# Day 12：CTE 练习",
      "",
      "# 1. 用 CTE 找出销量最高的书籍",
      "!docker exec pg-learn psql -U postgres -d learn -c \"",
      "WITH book_sales AS (",
      "    SELECT b.id, b.title, COALESCE(SUM(s.quantity), 0) AS total_sold",
      "    FROM bookstore.books b",
      "    LEFT JOIN bookstore.sales s ON b.id = s.book_id",
      "    GROUP BY b.id, b.title",
      ")",
      "SELECT title, total_sold",
      "FROM book_sales",
      "ORDER BY total_sold DESC",
      "LIMIT 5;",
      "\"",
      "",
      "print(\"---\")",
      "",
      "# 2. 链式 CTE：找出贡献了 50% 以上收入的书",
      "!docker exec pg-learn psql -U postgres -d learn -c \"",
      "WITH",
      "    book_revenue AS (",
      "        SELECT b.id, b.title, SUM(s.quantity * b.price) AS revenue",
      "        FROM bookstore.sales s",
      "        JOIN bookstore.books b ON s.book_id = b.id",
      "        GROUP BY b.id, b.title",
      "    ),",
      "    total_revenue AS (",
      "        SELECT SUM(revenue) AS total FROM book_revenue",
      "    )",
      "SELECT br.title, br.revenue,",
      "       ROUND(br.revenue / tr.total * 100, 1) AS 占比百分比",
      "FROM book_revenue br, total_revenue tr",
      "ORDER BY br.revenue DESC;",
      "\"",
      "",
      "print(\"---\")",
      "",
      "# 3. 递归 CTE：生成数字序列",
      "!docker exec pg-learn psql -U postgres -d learn -c \"",
      "WITH RECURSIVE numbers(n) AS (",
      "    SELECT 1",
      "    UNION ALL",
      "    SELECT n + 1 FROM numbers WHERE n < 20",
      ")",
      "SELECT n FROM numbers;",
      "\"",
      "",
      "print(\"---\")",
      "",
      "# 4. 递归 CTE：生成日期序列（可用于报表）",
      "!docker exec pg-learn psql -U postgres -d learn -c \"",
      "WITH RECURSIVE dates(d) AS (",
      "    SELECT '2024-01-01'::date",
      "    UNION ALL",
      "    SELECT d + 1 FROM dates WHERE d < '2024-01-15'",
      ")",
      "SELECT d::date FROM dates;",
      "\""
    ]
