      "---",
      "",
      "## Day 13：窗口函数",
      "",
      "窗口函数是 SQL 中最强大也最优雅的特性之一。它让你在**不改变行数**的情况下做聚合计算。",
      "",
      "### 窗口函数 vs GROUP BY",
      "",
      "| GROUP BY | 窗口函数 |",
      "|----------|----------|",
      "| 多行 → 一行（压缩了）| 多行 → 多行（不压缩） |",
      "| 只能看到聚合结果 | 既能看到明细又能看到聚合 |",
      "| `GROUP BY` + `HAVING` | `PARTITION BY` + `OVER` |",
      "",
      "### 语法",
      "",
      "```sql",
      "函数() OVER (",
      "    PARTITION BY col1   -- 按什么分组（可选）",
      "    ORDER BY col2       -- 组内排序（可选）",
      "    ROWS/RANGE BETWEEN ... -- 窗口范围（可选）",
      ")",
      "```",
      "",
      "### 三种类型的窗口函数",
      "",
      "#### 1. 排名类",
      "",
      "| 函数 | 特点 | 示例 |",
      "|------|------|------|",
      "| `ROW_NUMBER()` | 连续递增 1,2,3... | 唯一排名 |",
      "| `RANK()` | 相同值排名相同，有间隔 1,1,3 | 比赛排名 |",
      "| `DENSE_RANK()` | 相同值排名相同，无间隔 1,1,2 | 紧凑排名 |",
      "| `NTILE(n)` | 分成 n 个桶 | 四分位、十分位 |",
      "",
      "#### 2. 偏移类",
      "",
      "| 函数 | 说明 |",
      "|------|------|",
      "| `LAG(col, n)` | 取前 n 行的值 |",
      "| `LEAD(col, n)` | 取后 n 行的值 |",
      "",
      "#### 3. 聚合类",
      "",
      "`SUM() OVER(...)`、`AVG() OVER(...)`、`COUNT() OVER(...)` 等——在窗口上做聚合"
    ]
  },
  {
    "cell_id": "cell-16",
    "cell_type": "code",
    "source": [
      "# Day 13：窗口函数练习",
      "",
      "# 1. RANK：每本书的销售额排名",
      "!docker exec pg-learn psql -U postgres -d learn -c \"",
      "SELECT b.title,",
      "       COALESCE(SUM(s.quantity * b.price), 0) AS revenue,",
      "       RANK() OVER (ORDER BY SUM(s.quantity * b.price) DESC NULLS LAST) AS 排名",
      "FROM bookstore.books b",
      "LEFT JOIN bookstore.sales s ON b.id = s.book_id",
      "GROUP BY b.id, b.title",
      "ORDER BY 排名;",
      "\"",
      "",
      "print(\"---\")",
      "",
      "# 2. ROW_NUMBER、RANK、DENSE_RANK 对比",
      "!docker exec pg-learn psql -U postgres -d learn -c \"",
      "SELECT b.title,",
      "       COALESCE(SUM(s.quantity), 0) AS total_sold,",
      "       ROW_NUMBER() OVER (ORDER BY SUM(s.quantity) DESC NULLS LAST) AS row_num,",
      "       RANK()       OVER (ORDER BY SUM(s.quantity) DESC NULLS LAST) AS rank,",
      "       DENSE_RANK() OVER (ORDER BY SUM(s.quantity) DESC NULLS LAST) AS dense_rank",
      "FROM bookstore.books b",
      "LEFT JOIN bookstore.sales s ON b.id = s.book_id",
      "GROUP BY b.id, b.title",
      "ORDER BY total_sold DESC;",
      "\"",
      "",
      "print(\"---\")",
      "",
      "# 3. LAG：计算月度销售额环比",
      "!docker exec pg-learn psql -U postgres -d learn -c \"",
      "WITH monthly AS (",
      "    SELECT DATE_TRUNC('month', sale_date)::date AS month,",
      "           SUM(quantity * b.price) AS revenue",
      "    FROM bookstore.sales s",
      "    JOIN bookstore.books b ON s.book_id = b.id",
      "    GROUP BY DATE_TRUNC('month', sale_date)",
      ")",
      "SELECT month, revenue,",
      "       LAG(revenue) OVER (ORDER BY month) AS 上月收入,",
      "       COALESCE(ROUND((revenue - LAG(revenue) OVER (ORDER BY month)) / NULLIF(LAG(revenue) OVER (ORDER BY month), 0) * 100, 1), 0) AS 环比增长率",
      "FROM monthly",
      "ORDER BY month;",
      "\"",
      "",
      "print(\"---\")",
      "",
      "# 4. PARTITION BY + SUM OVER：在每个作者内，计算书的价格占比",
      "!docker exec pg-learn psql -U postgres -d learn -c \"",
      "SELECT a.name AS 作者, b.title AS 书名, b.price,",
      "       SUM(b.price) OVER (PARTITION BY a.id) AS 作者书籍总价,",
      "       ROUND(b.price / SUM(b.price) OVER (PARTITION BY a.id) * 100, 1) AS 占比",
      "FROM bookstore.books b",
      "JOIN bookstore.authors a ON b.author_id = a.id",
      "ORDER BY a.name, b.price DESC;",
      "\""
    ]
  },
  {
    "cell_id": "cell-17",
    "cell_type": "code",
    "source": [
      "# 5. 窗口函数的实用案例：找出每个分类下最贵的商品（分组 Top-N）",
      "!docker exec pg-learn psql -U postgres -d learn -c \"",
      "WITH ranked AS (",
      "    SELECT name, category, price,",
      "           ROW_NUMBER() OVER (PARTITION BY category ORDER BY price DESC) AS rn",
      "    FROM shop.products",
      ")",
      "SELECT category AS 分类, name AS 商品, price AS 价格",
      "FROM ranked",
      "WHERE rn = 1",
      "ORDER BY price DESC;",
      "\"",
      "",
      "print(\"---\")",
      "",
      "# 6. 累计求和：按月累计销售数量",
      "!docker exec pg-learn psql -U postgres -d learn -c \"",
      "SELECT DATE_TRUNC('month', sale_date)::date AS 月份,",
      "       SUM(quantity) AS 月销售量,",
      "       SUM(SUM(quantity)) OVER (ORDER BY DATE_TRUNC('month', sale_date)) AS 累计销售量",
      "FROM bookstore.sales",
      "GROUP BY DATE_TRUNC('month', sale_date)",
      "ORDER BY 月份;",
      "\""
    ]
  },
